[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Too Late]
[00:13.17]Did the detectives save the diamonds?
[00:20.15]The plane was late and detectives were waiting at the airport all morning.
[00:26.93]They were expecting a valuable parcel of diamonds from South Africa.
[00:33.19]A few hours earlier, someone had told the police that thieves would try to steal the diamonds.
[00:42.23]When the plane arrived, some of the detectives were waiting inside the main building while others were waiting on the airfield.
[00:53.54]Two men took the parcel off the plane and carried it into the Customs House.
[01:00.72]While two detectives were keeping guard at the door, two others opened the parcel.
[01:08.71]To their surprise, the precious parcel was full of stones and sand!
